SUMMARY:VRChat International Science Community
DESCRIPTION:集会: VRChat International Science Community 開催日時: 20
 27年1月2日 23:30 開催時間: 30分 Let's talk about science! We hold L
 Ts (Lightning Talks) hosted by group members about once every two weeks. Fe
 el free to join usǃ There's absolutely no need to worry about not knowing 
 anyone of the existing members․ We wish you a fruitful exchange․ Expect
 ed Level: University student (Year 1-2 undergraduate) level Field: Natural 
